    {
      "id": "story_13427_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "А: Жа́ль, есть ли бли́зко ста́нция метро́?",
      "text_en": "A: Sorry, is there a subway station nearby?",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"A\" data-defn=\"а\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">А</span><rt>A</rt></ruby>: <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhál&#x27;\" data-defn=\"жаль\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Жа́ль</span><rt>Zhál&#x27;</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"est&#x27;\" data-defn=\"есть\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">есть</span><rt>est&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"li\" data-defn=\"ли\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ли</span><rt>li</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"blízko\" data-defn=\"близко\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">бли́зко</span><rt>blízko</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"stántsiya\" data-defn=\"станция\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ста́нция</span><rt>stántsiya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"metró\" data-defn=\"метро\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">метро́</span><rt>metró</rt></ruby>?",
      "transliteration": "A: Zhál', est' li blízko stántsiya metró?",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.05,
      "duration": 3.05
    },
    {
      "id": "story_13427_p1_c0",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Б: Бли́жайшая ста́нция метро́ – это ста́нция Цен́трального парка, ря́дом с торго́вым центром.",
      "text_en": "B: The nearest subway station should be Century Park Station, next to the shopping mall.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"B\" data-defn=\"б\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Б</span><rt>B</rt></ruby>: <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Blízhayshaya\" data-defn=\"ближайшая\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Бли́жайшая</span><rt>Blízhayshaya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"stántsiya\" data-defn=\"станция\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ста́нция</span><rt>stántsiya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"metró\" data-defn=\"метро\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">метро́</span><rt>metró</rt></ruby> – <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eto\" data-defn=\"это\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">это</span><rt>eto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"stántsiya\" data-defn=\"станция\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ста́нция</span><rt>stántsiya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Tseńtral&#x27;nogo\" data-defn=\"центрального\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Цен́трального</span><rt>Tseńtral&#x27;nogo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"parka\" data-defn=\"парка\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">парка</span><rt>parka</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ryádom\" data-defn=\"рядом\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ря́дом</span><rt>ryádom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"s\" data-defn=\"с\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">с</span><rt>s</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"torgóvym\" data-defn=\"торговым\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">торго́вым</span><rt>torgóvym</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tsentrom\" data-defn=\"центром\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">центром</span><rt>tsentrom</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "B: Blízhayshaya stántsiya metró – eto stántsiya Tseńtral'nogo parka, ryádom s torgóvym tsentrom.",
      "start": 3.65,
      "end": 8.98,
      "duration": 5.33
    },
    {
      "id": "story_13427_p2_c0",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "А: Вы зна́ете, как до неё дойти́?",
      "text_en": "A: Do you know how to get there?",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"A\" data-defn=\"а\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">А</span><rt>A</rt></ruby>: <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Vy\" data-defn=\"вы\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Вы</span><rt>Vy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"znáete\" data-defn=\"знаете\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зна́ете</span><rt>znáete</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kak\" data-defn=\"как\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">как</span><rt>kak</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"do\" data-defn=\"до\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">до</span><rt>do</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"neyo\" data-defn=\"неё\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">неё</span><rt>neyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"doytí\" data-defn=\"дойти\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">дойти́</span><rt>doytí</rt></ruby>?",
      "transliteration": "A: Vy znáete, kak do neyo doytí?",
      "start": 9.58,
      "end": 12.0,
      "duration": 2.42
    },
    {
      "id": "story_13427_p3_c0",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "Б: Идите пря́мо по э́той до́роге, пройди́те че́рез ма́ленький сад, пово́рните ле́во у за́дней двер́и сада, а после́ ещё двух перекрёстков вы уви́дите госуда́рственную библиоте́ку.",
      "text_en": "B: Go straight ahead from this road, pass through a small garden, turn left at the back door of the garden, and after two more intersections, you will see the National Library.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"B\" data-defn=\"б\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Б</span><rt>B</rt></ruby>: <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Idite\" data-defn=\"идите\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Идите</span><rt>Idite</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pryámo\" data-defn=\"прямо\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пря́мо</span><rt>pryámo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"po\" data-defn=\"по\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">по</span><rt>po</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"étoy\" data-defn=\"этой\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">э́той</span><rt>étoy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dóroge\" data-defn=\"дороге\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">до́роге</span><rt>dóroge</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"proydíte\" data-defn=\"пройдите\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пройди́те</span><rt>proydíte</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chérez\" data-defn=\"через\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">че́рез</span><rt>chérez</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"málen&#x27;kiy\" data-defn=\"маленький\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ма́ленький</span><rt>málen&#x27;kiy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sad\" data-defn=\"сад\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сад</span><rt>sad</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"povórnite\" data-defn=\"поворните\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">пово́рните</span><rt>povórnite</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lévo\" data-defn=\"лево\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ле́во</span><rt>lévo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"u\" data-defn=\"у\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">у</span><rt>u</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zádney\" data-defn=\"задней\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">за́дней</span><rt>zádney</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dveŕi\" data-defn=\"двери\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">двер́и</span><rt>dveŕi</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sada\" data-defn=\"сада\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сада</span><rt>sada</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"a\" data-defn=\"а\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">а</span><rt>a</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"poslé\" data-defn=\"после\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">после́</span><rt>poslé</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"eshchyo\" data-defn=\"ещё\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ещё</span><rt>eshchyo</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dvukh\" data-defn=\"двух\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">двух</span><rt>dvukh</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"perekryostkov\" data-defn=\"перекрёстков\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">перекрёстков</span><rt>perekryostkov</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vy\" data-defn=\"вы\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">вы</span><rt>vy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"uvídite\" data-defn=\"увидите\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">уви́дите</span><rt>uvídite</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gosudárstvennuyu\" data-defn=\"государственную\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">госуда́рственную</span><rt>gosudárstvennuyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bibliotéku\" data-defn=\"библиотеку\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">библиоте́ку</span><rt>bibliotéku</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "B: Idite pryámo po étoy dóroge, proydíte chérez málen'kiy sad, povórnite lévo u zádney dveŕi sada, a poslé eshchyo dvukh perekryostkov vy uvídite gosudárstvennuyu bibliotéku.",
      "start": 12.6,
      "end": 21.36,
      "duration": 8.76
    },
    {
      "id": "story_13427_p3_c1",
      "chunk_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "Напротив библиотеки нахо́дится торго́вый центр в Цен́тральном парке.",
      "text_en": "Opposite the library is the shopping mall in Century Park.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Naprotiv\" data-defn=\"напротив\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Напротив</span><rt>Naprotiv</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"biblioteki\" data-defn=\"библиотеки\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">библиотеки</span><rt>biblioteki</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nakhóditsya\" data-defn=\"находится\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">нахо́дится</span><rt>nakhóditsya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"torgóvyy\" data-defn=\"торговый\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">торго́вый</span><rt>torgóvyy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tsentr\" data-defn=\"центр\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">центр</span><rt>tsentr</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"v\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">в</span><rt>v</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Tseńtral&#x27;nom\" data-defn=\"центральном\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Цен́тральном</span><rt>Tseńtral&#x27;nom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"parke\" data-defn=\"парке\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">парке</span><rt>parke</rt></ruby>.",
      "transliteration": "Naprotiv biblioteki nakhóditsya torgóvyy tsentr v Tseńtral'nom parke.",
      "start": 21.71,
      "end": 25.16,
      "duration": 3.45
    },
    {
      "id": "story_13427_p3_c2",
      "chunk_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "sentence_index": 2,
